  "description": "Optional read-only cluster state API add-on for Orleans.Lattice. Exposes a transport-agnostic facade (and, via a sibling binding, a gRPC surface) that lets external clients query, observe, and subscribe to a cluster's tree state and metadata - trees, shards, structure, entries and their history, views, tag indexes, and schema dead letters, plus live change and per-tree metrics subscriptions - for a tree-explorer dashboard and the Orleans.Lattice.Api.Mcp MCP server. Registered with a single AddLatticeStateApi(...) call.",
